<style>
/* K · Cormorant Garamond with Jost. Announcement bar, one-row header. Menus: capital text columns with a photograph flush right. Two buttons under the intro. */
:root{--display:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Jost",system-ui,sans-serif}
.logo{font-size:32px;font-weight:600}
.nav{margin-left:clamp(36px,4vw,64px);gap:clamp(18px,2vw,30px)}
.hero-copy h1{font:600 clamp(38px,3.8vw,60px)/1.02 var(--display)}
.hide-d{display:none}
@media (max-width:1080px){.hide-d{display:inline-flex}}
.sp + .ws{padding-top:0}
.sp:has(+ .ws){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.bh + .sp-size{padding-top:0}
.sp-size + .pv-k{padding-top:0}
.sp-size:has(+ .pv-k){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .rv{padding-top:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .bd2{padding-top:0}
.bd2 + .rv{padding-top:0}
.rv.r1 .cards{align-items:stretch}
.rv.r1 .cd{border-top:0;padding-top:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
.rv.r1 .cd .rq{flex:1}
/* one rhythm: every section below the hero sits the same distance apart */
:root{--sec:clamp(56px,6vw,88px)}
main > section:not(.hero):not(.next){padding-top:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-top:var(--sec)!important;margin-bottom:0!important}
main > section.next{margin-top:var(--sec)}
</style>

<div class="dw lg"><header class="dw-hero"><div class="dw-w"><nav class="dz-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/pages/help">Help</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Accessibility</span></nav><h1>Accessibility</h1><p>We want everyone to be able to shop with us comfortably, whatever device or assistive technology they use.</p><p class="lg-upd">Last updated 12 November 2026</p></div></header><div class="dw-body dw-w"><aside class="dw-side"><div class="dw-on"><span>On this page</span><a href="#aim">Our aim</a><a href="#features">What we&rsquo;ve done</a><a href="#known">Known issues</a><a href="#help">Getting help</a></div></aside><div class="dw-main"><section id="aim"><h2>Our aim</h2><p>We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA. That means clear text, good contrast, everything usable with a keyboard, and descriptions for images.</p></section><section id="features"><h2>What we&rsquo;ve done</h2><ul class="dw-notes"><li>Text and backgrounds have strong contrast, and you can zoom the page to 200% without losing anything.</li><li>Every page works with a keyboard and with screen readers.</li><li>Images have text descriptions, and video plays without sound.</li><li>If you&rsquo;ve asked your device to reduce motion, our animations switch off.</li></ul></section><section id="known"><h2>Known issues</h2><p>Some content from other companies, such as payment options and review widgets, may not fully meet the standard. We&rsquo;re working with them to improve it.</p></section><section id="help"><h2>Getting help</h2><p>If anything on the site is difficult to use, or you need information in a different format, email [hello@axelandhound.co.uk] and we&rsquo;ll help you place your order another way.</p></section><section class="dw-help"><h2>Still need help?</h2><p>Our team is here Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm, and replies to every message within one working day.</p><a class="dw-btn" href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a></section></div></div></div>


